{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"After all files are uploaded, prepare a request for an offer. Returns a confirmation_url the customer must open to review and confirm. Confirming sends a request for an offer, not an order. Give the customer the link; keep quote_status_key private. If the customer says the link was already opened, expired (a session lasts 15 minutes) or lost, call it again with the same request_id, request_key and analysis: it returns a fresh confirmation_url and a new quote_status_key, and links not yet opened stop working. Earlier quote_status_keys remain subject to the same sharing permission, expiry and revocation as the newest key; always use and keep the newest one. Re-issuance requires the same analysis on an unsubmitted, unexpired request; changed analysis gives CONFLICT and at most 10 confirmation links may be issued per request. Fails if files are missing, so never call it after a failed upload. Do not use re-issuance to recover denied status access.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"analysis":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"files":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"file_id":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$","type":"string"},"format":{"enum":["stl","obj","3mf"],"type":"string"},"plates":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$","type":"string"},"mesh":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"dimensions_mm":{"items":false,"maxItems":3,"minItems":3,"prefixItems":[{"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"minimum":0,"type":"number"}],"type":"array"},"horizontal_area_mm2":{"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"overhang_percentage":{"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"surface_area_mm2":{"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"thin_wall_percentage":{"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"triangle_co